        <detaileddescription>
<para>Depending on the measurement, it&apos;s intrinsic references, the processing context&apos;s explicit references and the internal camera calibration itself the availability of a mode varies.</para>
<para>Use this function, to check whether a specific mode is explicitly possible for a measurement.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">i_procCont</parametername>
